# E-learning Enrollment
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: E-learning — a Student's enrollment in a Course, fourth CAP-F20
# many-to-many instance (after Follow, Like, Membership); completing it triggers
# a generated Certificate
# Case 21 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: elearning-course.menata, elearning-certificate.menata

Enrollment

Fields

- Student : User
- Course : Course
- Enrolled At : Date
- Progress : Number
- Status : In Progress | Completed

Events

When Complete

    if Progress is greater than or equal to 100

        Status Completed

        Issue Certificate

Constraints

- Student is required.
- Course is required.

    A Student may enroll in a given Course only once.

Permissions

Student

- Enroll
- Complete

Views

- My Enrollments : List
- Course Roster : List
